      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At <strong>Packers and Movers in Chintadripet</strong>, every relocation begins with a meticulous pre‑move assessment. Our team conducts a thorough video walkthrough or a hands‑on physical survey of your property.</p>
